{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monster Hunting Party is a survival game where you can recruit unique units to help fight against ravaging monsters. You can also combine them to make stronger units, there're 30+ combinations for you to explore. Once you have a certain types of unit in your party, they will form a formation and unlock strong buffs or devastating skills to obliterate enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The current Demo has:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 playable level</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >12 commanders</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50 units to choose from</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >13 formations, created by having specific units in the party</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 normal enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 bosses</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the released game there will be:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 more playable levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More commanders</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More formations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Treasure system to help boost the party's power</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4063930?t=1759856740","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4063930?t=1759856740","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063930/b52f1e60027cd07a3c11f7cbc7d4c7c072de3193/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759856740","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063930/b52f1e60027cd07a3c11f7cbc7d4c7c072de3193/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759856740","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game